          "What an absolute dump of a hotel and one of the worst stays I’ve ever experienced. Pankaj, the manager, is a complete disgrace and has no business working in hospitality.\n\nMy fiancé and I stayed here for 6 days with no consistently functioning Wi-Fi and no reliable hot water. Let that sink in. The hotel literally turns off the water boiler every evening to save money, so if you shower after a certain time, you’re stuck with cold water. We had to repeatedly badger them daily just to turn the boiler back on. Hot water is not a luxury—it’s a bare minimum expectation.\n\nOn top of that, there was no Wi-Fi for the first four days. Every day we were fed excuses about it being “worked on,” yet absolutely nothing improved. The TV barely had any channels, the sink in the bathroom smelled like a dirty sewage, the breakfast was weak, and the entire place looked like an unfinished, poorly maintained building that should never have been opened to guests.\n\nThe cherry on top: when my fiancé raised these issues, the clown manager Pankaj flat-out said, “I don’t care about the reputation of the hotel.” That tells you everything you need to know. Utterly unprofessional, arrogant, and clueless—a total clown.\n\nDO NOT STAY HERE. This place cuts corners, ignores guests, and doesn’t even pretend to care. Save yourself the frustration—you will regret booking this hotel.\n\nAlso- I don’t want a copy/paste response from the hotel so please save yourself the hassle and get lost.",
