        Rating: 5,
        Description:
          "During my frequent business travel to Delhi, I generally used to stay in this Hotel due to its locational advantage. However, after my experience of stay this time I will make sure that I always stay here for my next trips. Shikha and Sunil was so helpful and exceptional in service that I must recognise them.\nI had a fast for a day during my stay and I had requested the chef whether he can prepare breakfast for me accordingly. Though it was out of their menu, he took special care in preparing that and Sunil personally served me with full respect and care - it felt very satisfying.\nDuring the breakfast the next day, Shikha guided me to choose special Paratha and got it served with due care.\nOverall, excellent experience to make me decide to always stay here in future.",
