        Rating: 5,
        Description:
          "I stayed at The Hosteller Delhi from 30th Jan to 3rd Feb 2026, and it was an absolutely fantastic experience. The service was truly top-notch — the staff were warm, professional, and always ready to help, which made the stay very comfortable.\n\nThe stand-up comedy event was a pleasant surprise and thoroughly entertaining — a great way to unwind in the evenings. The food was delicious, well prepared, and honestly exceeded expectations.\n\nCleanliness, ambience, food, and overall hospitality were all excellent.\n\n👏 Highly recommended!",
