        Rating: 4,
        Description:
          "Good deal for the price/location (close to metro and Humayun's Tomb). The quality of the hostel was well below the other two hosteller locations I visited (Goa and Agra), particularly in my 8b dorm but better than other hostels I've stayed at for a similar price. Receptionist was competent at checkin but didn't tell me anything about the hostel (like the basement lounge or events they have). The rooms don't have door locks like the other two locations so you have to be a little more careful with leaving belongings there (they have good sized lockers below beds; mine had been taken by another person because his was broken. You can bring a lock for that and a small lockbox in the bedframe or you can buy them from the hostel).",
