        Rating: 5,
        Description:
          "Overall, great stay and my thanks to Nithin for his hospitality.\n\nPros:\n\n1. Finding the hotel was very easy. This hotel is centrally located in Lajpat nagar near the Croma showroom in the service road running parallel to ring road.\n2. Spacious rooms with table, sofa, TV, Heater. You have enough plug points to charge your devices.\n3. Dinner / Breakfast were very good and affordable. Good options is the menu\n4. Lajpat Nagar metro station and market are very nearby.\n5. Hotel staff were kind and courteous including security chacha with a moustache 🙂\n6. They have a spacious restroom in the ground floor which can be used to changing/refreshing, if you are planning to leave your big luggages in the hotel post checkout.\n\nCons:\n1. Lift available but still only go upto 4th floor, where breakfast is served. Maybe a bit tough for seniors\n2. Centralised AC is available, however it was not working. I didn’t require an AC, since the weather in Delhi was cold during the time I went.\n3. The property is a bit old , hence you might feel the old smell (if you know what I mean), however it was not there too much.",
