        Rating: 1,
        Description:
          "We had booked 3 Rooms for 2 Nights on oct 2025. Although the room quality was top. Even the room service was good. Only fault on this hotel is thier lift is very slow and they dont allow outside food till 10pm.\nOne think i found bad about this hotel was they asked for full payment while checking into hotel. I have travelled half of India but never any hotel asked full payment on checkinn day. This shows bad customer support from thier side.\nAlso we travel lajpatnagar delhi frequently and I suggest that hotel delheez which is opposite side of this hotel is good as we stay there only and this time it was full so we had to stay here.\nRest staff was good and they even helped us to load our luggage on car",
        Images: null,
        When: "",
