        Rating: 1,
        Description:
          "I strongly advise against staying at this hotel. My experience was horrible from start to finish.\nAs soon as I entered my room, I was hit with a terrible bad smell that never went away. To make matters worse, the room was not clean at all, and it was clear that the staff maintains no hygiene standards.\nThe bathroom was another major issue. Water was constantly coming out from the bathroom area, wetting the floor outside and creating a slippery, unsanitary mess.\nThis was a horrible experience, and I would recommend everyone to avoid this place. Do not stay here.",
