        Rating: 1,
        Description:
          "The hotel was extremely disappointing in terms of room condition, staff behavior, and overall maintenance. When I checked in, I was given a room with a non-functional AC. Upon requesting a change, I was told there were no rooms available with a working AC. To make matters worse, the room door did not even have a proper lock. When I raised this concern, the staff casually responded that no one would enter the room, so it wasn’t an issue.\n\nWhen I escalated the complaint to MMT, the hotel people were lying to them and they blamed me by saying I had refused the room and that ACs were working in all rooms, which was completely untrue. The pictures shown online are misleading and do not reflect the actual condition of the property.\n\nOverall, this was the worst hotel experience I have ever had, and I would strongly advise others not to book this place.",
        Images: null,
        When: "",
