        Rating: 5,
        Description:
          "Great accomodation to stay at, very near to the Lajpat Nagr Metro ! It’s right off a near main road so you will hear honking, but that’s as expected in India!\n\nThe rooms are very nice, comfortable bedding and good pressure showers.\n\nThe service is great, always happy to help, especially at breakfast.  provided exceptional service, attending to requests with a smile and were very kind. The breakfast food selection is great.\nWould recommend!",
